  "snapshot_tree": "a8ba4bcc213c29f78aec61e4f64139444d3b0d1b",
  "patch": "diff --git a/docs/adr/0033-acceptance-truth-presentation-and-cohort-parity.md b/docs/adr/0033-acceptance-truth-presentation-and-cohort-parity.md\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 00000000..481f7985\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/docs/adr/0033-acceptance-truth-presentation-and-cohort-parity.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@\n+# ADR-0033：验收事实照实呈现——报告在聊天交付、核查不分 cohort、缺事实不阻断\n+\n+2026-09-22；方向已由任务 workflowhub-thin-core-card-04-20260919 的 make-decision 真实交互确认（outline-talk 第 1 批 Q1–Q4、grill-with-docs 第 1–3 批 G1–G7b），本文纳入该任务最终一次整体确认。本文记录方向；实施与验收状态以当前任务事实为准，不授权删除、提交或交付。历史材料原拟编号 0032；2026-09-26 发现该号已由已跟踪的 `docs/adr/0032-review-chain-delegation-and-layer-contract.md` 使用。本卡在 2026-09-27 仅将自己的落库编号改为当前空闲的 0033，历史用户原话和旧执行原件保留原编号，不把迁号当成新的方向批准。\n+\n+## 背景\n+\n+旧验收链已构造来源与覆盖限制的槽位，但部分槽位没有接上真实事实。pre 卡的验收核查还被 cohort 分支绕过。用户要求交付质量能从实际验收结果判断，坏消息须直接呈现给人，不能由流程绿灯代替。\n+\n+## 决策\n+\n+WorkflowHub 的验收事实必须**照实呈现给人看**，而不是靠机器把流程判绿。据此定下三件事。其一，build-code 结束时对逐条验收链做的机器核查**不再按 activation cohort 分叉**：原先只有 post 卡会执行这一核查（`runtime/stage/stage-runner.mjs:4289-4293`，build-plan 同形分支在 `:4297-4298`），pre 卡永远不执行，而 pre 卡的逐条验收链恰恰是空槽最集中的地方。其二，阶段结束时由**独立子代理**（独立上下文、未参与实现）依据机器事实写一份大白话验收报告，主会话**原样贴进聊天**交给用户；用户此前明确表示不看 handoff 文件、不经过命令行，因此交付现场是聊天而不是产物文件。其三，报告结构不对称：没做到、失败、没跑过的一律由机器事实逐条枚举、原样列出、**不许总结**；通过的压成一行汇总并配可展开的步骤清单；每条结论挂它的来源。验收链复用既有的 `source_ids`/`decision_ids`/`fr_ids`、`subject_fact.execution` 与 `coverage_limits` 字段；后续已确认的实现方案另增 `runtime/stage/stage-end-report.mjs` 和 `stage-end-report-facts.v1` 作为报告事实层。两者不得成为新的阶段、推进门、计数器或第二份执行账本；缺事实继续如实披露。\n+\n+所否决的方案有五类。**对称压缩**（好坏都总结、长度固定很短）最好读，但「总结」正是美化的入口：CARD-02 的父会话曾报「148/148 全绿」而被自己委派的独立复查全盘推翻，CARD-07 也曾把子代理的否决漂白成绿。**由主会话执笔**最快且上下文最全，但执笔人就是实施者，与上两例同源。**机器直接生成**零人为空间，却会把大白话退化成字段名堆砌。**新建激活标记把 cohort 翻成 post** 被否决有两条硬理由：它救不了本卡（cohort 在建卡时即冻结进任务档案，`runtime/task/task-topology.mjs:97-99`），而且合法标记必须引用一份能力验收与一次入口消费的记录（`tools/cli/task-bootstrap.mjs:52-57`），这两份记录在整个仓库与整个 Knowledge 库内都不存在，全仓也没有任何代码会写该文件——手工创建等于伪造发布闸门。**逐个加阻断门**（缺结果即失败）同样被否决：实测爆炸半径为 562/707（79.5%）条已记录阶段结果会新增失败，且与 SD-17「不阻断推进」正面冲突；用户已明确「不是流程正确，而是质量合格」。\n+\n+## 后果\n+\n+三项判据均成立：以后若要恢复 cohort 分叉或改回由实施者自述验收，需要重新划分核查边界并重新说服用户接受一份可能被美化的报告，改变方向有实际成本；没有背景时维护者可能把「报告在聊天里交付、由异源执笔」误当流程随意性而重建回产物文件，或把「缺事实不阻断」误当缺陷而补上阻断门；本案在对称压缩与非对称压缩、异源执笔与自述、放开 cohort 分叉与伪造激活标记、加阻断门与只呈现事实之间都存在真实取舍，用户均已选择后者。此决定不意味着降低验收要求，也不宣称聊天报告具有机器认证的强度——它保证的是**坏消息没有美化空间**，而不是流程不可绕过。\n+\n+来源：`specs/workflowhub-thin-core-card-04-20260919/decision-log.md` 的 `## 三轮 talk` 与 `## grill` 两节；owner = 本任务 make-decision 主会话；consumer = 最终确认、build-plan 与 build-code 的阶段末报告实现。它补充验收事实的呈现与核查边界，不取代历史 ADR 对当前实现的记录，不新增运行时对象。\ndiff --git a/docs/architecture/complexity-baseline.json b/docs/architecture/complexity-baseline.json\nindex fc713478..d4ac7cfe 100644\n--- a/docs/architecture/complexity-baseline.json\n+++ b/docs/architecture/complexity-baseline.json\n@@ -57,11 +57,12 @@\n   },\n   \"budgets\": {\n     \"formal_test_lines\": {\n-      \"actual\": 20292,\n+      \"actual\": 84399,\n       \"target\": 10000,\n       \"limit\": 12000,\n-      \"delta_from_target\": 10292,\n-      \"within_limit\": false\n+      \"delta_from_target\": 74399,\n+      \"within_limit\": false,\n+      \"caliber\": \"buildReport() 只读内存测量：按当前工作树内容统计 Git 已跟踪的正式测试源码行数（*.test.* 与 __tests__，限源码扩展名）；当前约为 12000 行上限的 7.0 倍。直接执行 node tools/architecture/complexity-report.mjs 的默认路径会覆写本 JSON，有副作用；本条数字须随正式测试文件变化复测。本次 formal_test_lines.actual=84399 取自 2026-09-27 当前工作树已跟踪测试，HEAD ef920f1fbd415fe87d50930359059b661e141acd；顶层 source.git_head=b50818ba0bd092b579eb80c1cbfa10b1b60d366e 及除 formal_test_lines 块外的字段仍是历史快照。整份 JSON 不是同一当前快照；手动 --check-hard-gates 全报表对账仍会报 stale，不能将本文件整体宣称 current。\"\n     },\n     \"production_lines\": {\n       \"actual\": 27044,\ndiff --git a/docs/architecture/move-map.json b/docs/architecture/move-map.json\nindex 33868b48..75ec89b4 100644\n--- a/docs/architecture/move-map.json\n+++ b/docs/architecture/move-map.json\n@@ -3502,6 +3502,70 @@\n       \"consumer\": \"explicit targeted wallclock run and CARD-05 P5 evidence readback for direct OCR no-timeout behavior\",\n       \"delete_condition\": \"retain until an approved replacement supplies equivalent real-wallclock evidence for direct OCR waiting and fast-result retention\",\n       \"content_change\": \"controlled real-child experiment observes fast finding retention while another provider remains active beyond 21 minutes; fixture findings are not LLM quality verdicts\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"docs/quality/business-case-catalog.json\",\n+      \"destination\": \"docs/quality/business-case-catalog.json\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P8 business rule owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"P9 change trigger and P10 business reconciliation readers\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove only when an independently reviewed single business catalog replaces it and P9/P10 consumers migrate\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"finite versioned CARD-04 business case relationships, rule source metadata, and additive v1 future canonical effect-observation contracts; not_yet_observed is not an effect fact\",\n+      \"sha256_after\": \"60288229ae854083d62c9cfefca3778db7752d78a1d48f29a0698d78014bd41b\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"tests/contract/business-case-source-binding.test.mjs\",\n+      \"destination\": \"tests/contract/business-case-source-binding.test.mjs\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P8/T017 test owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"targeted Vitest and verify-code review of business catalog source bindings\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove after an independently reviewed equivalent source binding target replaces it and old RED is retained\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"tests catalog source/rule revisions against actual source bytes and wrong-source failures\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"docs/quality/test-asset-registry.json\",\n+      \"destination\": \"docs/quality/test-asset-registry.json\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P9/T019 test asset owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"workflows/build-code/test-asset-inventory.mjs independent registry reader\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove when a reviewed existing test registry becomes the sole reader source and all P9/P10 consumers migrate\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"finite versioned test file, command and full leaf identity registry independent of the business catalog\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"tests/contract/build-code-preexecution-source.test.mjs\",\n+      \"destination\": \"tests/contract/build-code-preexecution-source.test.mjs\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P9/T018 test owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"targeted Vitest and verify-code review of pre-run task change source\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove after equivalent authenticated pre-run source tests replace it and old RED is retained\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"tests task bootstrap and current Git change scope before any current test receipt exists\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"tests/contract/build-code-test-registry.test.mjs\",\n+      \"destination\": \"tests/contract/build-code-test-registry.test.mjs\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P9/T019 test owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"targeted Vitest and verify-code review of independent test registry reader\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove after equivalent registry versus reporter leaf tests replace it and old RED is retained\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"tests independent registry and complete reporter leaf reconciliation with missing extra skip and duplicate failures\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"workflows/build-code/targeted-capture.mjs\",\n+      \"destination\": \"workflows/build-code/targeted-capture.mjs\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P10/T020 build-code owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"fixed private command launched only by workflows/build-code/capture.mjs\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove when capture.mjs or an independently reviewed single private executor takes over its verified behavior\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"private authenticated targeted test launch and per-case evidence collection without a new public command\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"source\": \"tests/contract/build-code-targeted-capture.test.mjs\",\n+      \"destination\": \"tests/contract/build-code-targeted-capture.test.mjs\",\n+      \"status\": \"add\",\n+      \"owner\": \"CARD-04 P10/T020 test owner\",\n+      \"consumer\": \"targeted Vitest and verify-code review of the fixed private launcher\",\n+      \"delete_condition\": \"remove after equivalent same-task targeted execution journey tests replace it and old RED is retained\",\n+      \"content_change\": \"tests fixed launcher identity, fresh execution, safe argv, raw evidence and negative paths\"\n     }\n   ]\n }\ndiff --git a/runtime/evidence/acceptance-evidence-validator.mjs b/runtime/evidence/acceptance-evidence-validator.mjs\nindex 8364dd1f..1ebbedc9 100644\n--- a/runtime/evidence/acceptance-evidence-validator.mjs\n+++ b/runtime/evidence/acceptance-evidence-validator.mjs\n@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@ const GIT_OID = /^[a-f0-9]{40}$/i;\n const ACCEPTANCE_ID = /^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._:-]{0,127}$/;\n const ANCHOR_PATH = /^(?:[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*)(?:\\/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*)*$/;\n const EVIDENCE_REF = /^(?:evidence|quality\\/evidence)\\/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*(?:\\/[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*)*$/;\n+const ACCEPTANCE_RESULTS = [\"pass\", \"fail\", \"inconclusive\", \"deferred\", \"missing\", \"inconsistent\", \"incomplete\", \"unavailable\"];\n \n function validateSummaryAnchor(value, label) {\n   if (!value || typeof value !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(value)) throw new Error(`${label} must be an anchor object`);\n@@ -28,7 +29,7 @@ export function validateAcceptanceEvidence(value, label = \"acceptance evidence\")\n   for (const key of Object.keys(value)) if (![\"schema_version\", \"acceptance_criterion_id\", \"result\", \"refs\", \"snapshot_tree\", \"source_digest\", \"summary\", \"freshness\"].includes(key)) throw new Error(`${label} has unknown field ${key}`);\n   if (value.schema_version !== \"acceptance-evidence.v1\") throw new Error(`${label} schema_version must be acceptance-evidence.v1`);\n   if (typeof value.acceptance_criterion_id !== \"string\" || !ACCEPTANCE_ID.test(value.acceptance_criterion_id)) throw new Error(`${label} acceptance_criterion_id must be stable and non-empty`);\n-  if (!new Set([\"pass\", \"fail\", \"inconclusive\", \"deferred\"]).has(value.result)) throw new Error(`${label} result must be pass, fail, inconclusive, or deferred`);\n+  if (!ACCEPTANCE_RESULTS.includes(value.result)) throw new Error(`${label} result must be one of ${ACCEPTANCE_RESULTS.join(\", \")}`);\n   if (!Array.isArray(value.refs) || value.refs.length === 0) throw new Error(`${label} refs must be a non-empty array`);\n   const refs = value.refs.map((entry, index) => {\n     if (!entry || typeof entry !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(entry) || Object.keys(entry).some((key) => ![\"ref\", \"sha256\"].includes(key)) || typeof entry.ref !== \"string\" || !EVIDENCE_REF.test(entry.ref) || !SHA256_HEX.test(entry.sha256 ?? \"\")) throw new Error(`${label} refs[${index}] must contain canonical ref and sha256`);\ndiff --git a/runtime/evidence/freshness.mjs b/runtime/evidence/freshness.mjs\nindex 2882c303..1b116596 100644\n--- a/runtime/evidence/freshness.mjs\n+++ b/runtime/evidence/freshness.mjs\n@@ -1,14 +1,21 @@\n import { createHash } from \"node:crypto\";\n+import { readFileSync } from \"node:fs\";\n+import { join } from \"node:path\";\n import { SHA256_HEX } from \"./canonical-utils.mjs\";\n import { Buffer } from \"node:buffer\";\n import { execFileSync } from \"node:child_process\";\n import Ajv2020 from \"ajv/dist/2020.js\";\n \n-import { CLOSE_PLAN_REF, WORKFLOWHUB_CURRENT_SESSION_SOURCE_ID, WORKFLOWHUB_CURRENT_SESSION_BINDING_KIND, acceptanceExecutionOutcomeStatus, deriveAcceptanceExecutionAssertions, isHumanConfirmationVersion, validateAcceptanceExecutionEvidence, validateCanonicalFullTestReceipt, validateCanonicalQualityFact, validateCanonicalTestReceipt, validateHumanConfirmation, validateStageOutcomeProducerIdentity, validateStageOutcomeProof } from \"./canonical-evidence-validators.mjs\";\n+import { CLOSE_PLAN_REF, WORKFLOWHUB_CURRENT_SESSION_SOURCE_ID, WORKFLOWHUB_CURRENT_SESSION_BINDING_KIND, acceptanceExecutionOutcomeStatus, deriveAcceptanceExecutionAssertions, isHumanConfirmationVersion, validateAcceptanceExecutionEvidence, validateCanonicalFullTestReceipt, validateCanonicalImplementationReceipt, validateCanonicalQualityFact, validateCanonicalTestReceipt, validateHumanConfirmation, validateStageOutcomeProducerIdentity, validateStageOutcomeProof } from \"./canonical-evidence-validators.mjs\";\n import { validateAcceptanceEvidence } from \"./acceptance-evidence-validator.mjs\";\n import browserQaSchema from \"../schemas/browser-qa-evidence.v1.json\" with { type: \"json\" };\n import { validateSchema } from \"../review/schema-validator.mjs\";\n-import { STAGE_FACT_MATERIALS } from \"../stage/completion-predicates.mjs\";\n+import { STAGE_FACT_MATERIALS, stageFactMaterialFiles, stageMaterialScopeRevision } from \"../stage/completion-predicates.mjs\";\n+import { buildStageEndReportFacts, renderStageEndReport } from \"../stage/stage-end-report.mjs\";\n+import { captureWorkspaceSnapshot } from \"./canonical-receipt-writer.mjs\";\n+import { openCurrentTaskWorkspace } from \"../task/workspace.mjs\";\n+import { assertTaskHandle } from \"../task/task-handle.mjs\";\n+import { ArtifactDir } from \"../../core/artifact-dir.mjs\";\n import { ensureGitSnapshotObjectStore } from \"../task/git-worktree-snapshot.mjs\";\n import { canonicalReviewFindings, isActionableSeriousFinding } from \"../review/stage-review-disposition.mjs\";\n import { authenticateCanonicalReviewResult } from \"../review/canonical-review-result.mjs\";\n@@ -315,11 +322,9 @@ function readBound(binding, read, dependencies, key) {\n function expectedPassed(status, passed, failed, nonterminal) {\n   if (status === \"passed\") return passed;\n   if (status === \"failed\") return failed;\n-  // A missing quality fact is the canonical projection for an acceptance\n-  // subject that is inconclusive/deferred. Preserve that distinction in the\n-  // bound leaf without treating it as either a pass or an implementation\n-  // failure.\n-  if (status === \"missing\") return nonterminal === \"inconclusive\" || nonterminal === \"deferred\";\n+  // A missing quality fact can carry any nonterminal acceptance result.\n+  // Preserve the bound leaf without treating it as a pass or implementation failure.\n+  if (status === \"missing\") return [\"inconclusive\", \"deferred\", \"missing\", \"inconsistent\", \"incomplete\", \"unavailable\"].includes(nonterminal);\n   return false;\n }\n \n@@ -408,6 +413,72 @@ function authenticateBrowserAcceptance(value, fact, scenario, read, dependencies\n   if (outputRaw === undefined) throw new Error(\"browser acceptance test output is unavailable\");\n }\n \n+function authenticateBrowserUiQaProjection(projection, browserSources, browserItems, binding, fact, aggregateStatus) {\n+  if (browserSources.length === 0) {\n+    if (projection === undefined) return;\n+    const unavailableBrowser = browserItems.length > 0 && browserItems.every((item) =>\n+      new Set([\"unavailable\", \"failed\"]).has(item.status) && item.evidence_refs.length === 0);\n+    if (unavailableBrowser && aggregateStatus === \"missing\" && fact.status === \"missing\"\n+        && projection && typeof projection === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(projection)\n+        && projection.status === \"unknown\" && typeof projection.reason === \"string\"\n+        && projection.reason.trim() && Array.isArray(projection.items) && projection.items.length === 0) return;\n+    throw new Error(\"UI QA projection has no browser execution source\");\n+  }\n+  // Old non-passing browser aggre